%p
  From every booster, draft two cards, and pass the rest to the next player,
  until all cards have been drafted.
  Direction changes with every booster.
%p
  From cards you draft, build a deck of at least 60 cards, following Commander
  deck construction rules, except that your deck can contain any number of cards
  with the same name, and there is no maximum deck size.
- limited_format.filler_commanders.each do |card|
  %p
    You can also add up to two copies of
    = link_to_card(card) do
      = card.name
    to your card pool, but only if you use them as your commander.
%p
  Games are played as multiplayer Commander games.
  = link_to "See rule 903.13 for the full rules.", controller: "help", action: "rules", anchor: "section-903-13"
